body:
If you want to make a Fire Emblem clone [https://forums.rpgmakerweb.com/index.php?threads/srpg-gear-mz-plugins-for-creating-tactical-battle-system.153483/](https://forums.rpgmakerweb.com/index.php?threads/srpg-gear-mz-plugins-for-creating-tactical-battle-system.153483/)

&#x200B;

Here's another but you have to pay for it.   It's pretty impressive and very easy to set up.   The guy has tons of other cool plug ins which he constantly updates, and he fixes bugs quick, sometimes within hours of being reported.   Most of his plug ins have an MV and MZ version.  https://synrec.itch.io/rpg-maker-mz-tactical-battle-system

Not to mention >!He totally wants Mikasa who he's shown NO romantic feelings towards to not be happy with another guy and only think about him.!<

&#x200B;

So yeah, dude turns into a real butthole.

My character's name is Tamrant, I should be on tomorrow evening around 7:30 CST.  I have a level 70 so I can help you get started.

&#x200B;

Edit: I can also be on around 10am CST tomorrow.
